{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWorld of Chaos\u300b is a 2D cartoon shooting game where you will control a mercenary group to explore the world, engage in trade, and fight battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can highly customize your mercenary group, including but not limited to: primary weapons, secondary weapons, melee weapons, throwing weapons, etc, and also learn various skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718900/extras/fa4b3e5a218e1ca5d1831cf97c8d4f00.poster.avif?t=1768693906\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718900/extras/fa4b3e5a218e1ca5d1831cf97c8d4f00.webm?t=1768693906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718900/extras/fa4b3e5a218e1ca5d1831cf97c8d4f00.mp4?t=1768693906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718900/extras/83fbfdf1ff74aba870823ad09cbe52a4.avif?t=1768693906\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can replace various types of bullets for your weapons.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718900/extras/442530232c8a255f52bb18489752c1c2.avif?t=1768693906\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run businesses around the world, buy and sell goods, and trigger various random events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718900/extras/3107d6887b2c03d296cb5655a4262b30.avif?t=1768693906\" width=308 height=174 /></span><span cl